msgstr "縮圖管理"

#: tips:124 tips:181
msgid "Pinboard"
msgstr "桌面"

#: tips:125
msgid "When using a pinboard, you can drag files and applications onto the desktop background to create shortcuts to them."
msgstr "當啟用桌面時，您可拖放檔案或程式到桌面上它們會以捷徑型式出現. "

#: tips:126 tips:238
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外觀"

